(7) To call special meetings of the city council as provided herein;
(8) To appoint at the first meeting each year (or as soon thereafter as expedient), for a term of that year, a gas system liaison and members of the following standing committees: police committee, fire committee, water, sewer and mechanic committee, street and sanitation committee, general administration committee, finance committee, community affairs committee, parks committee, and such other committees as the mayor and council may deem necessary;
